{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A square dog's great adventure in a hotel where everything has turned square!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll, bounce, and collect to get through the rooms in seconds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909570/extras/37eda162f0ebb9b03ef3f94c16ecb7c9.poster.avif?t=1771945172\" width=590 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909570/extras/37eda162f0ebb9b03ef3f94c16ecb7c9.webm?t=1771945172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909570/extras/37eda162f0ebb9b03ef3f94c16ecb7c9.mp4?t=1771945172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious virus has turned everything in a resort hotel square -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The buildings, the furniture, and even the dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of Wanko, a square dog, and journey deep into the hotel in search of his lost family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To open the locked doors in each room, you must use physics to clear away scattered objects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the &quot;truth&quot; he discovers at the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909570/extras/423c4405d00931ed2eb9d066b6f35998.poster.avif?t=1771945172\" width=558 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909570/extras/423c4405d00931ed2eb9d066b6f35998.webm?t=1771945172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://share